data_nbse2
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [nbse2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Metallic 2H-a NbSe2, P6_3/mmc: Nb occupies aligned 2b columns and Se occupies
# 4f with z=0.116. Lattice: Wang et al., Appl. Phys. Lett. 123, 153505 (2023),
# doi:10.1063/5.0172460. The z value is the lower end of the experimental
# 0.116-0.118 range summarized by Johannes, Mazin, and Howells, Phys. Rev. B 73,
# 205102 (2006), from primary crystallographic reports including Brown and
# Beerntsen, Acta Cryst. 18, 31 (1965), doi:10.1107/S0365110X65000063. Basis
# prototype: AFLOW AB2_hP6_194_b_f-002. Assumes the room-temperature,
# unmodulated bulk cell (not the low-temperature CDW supercell). Limiting checks:
# two Nb + four Se, V=(sqrt(3)/2)a^2c, and aligned Nb columns.
# Validation: nbse2-2ha-structure
